"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-03-02T11:36:19Z","updated_at":"2026-06-07T10:53:45Z","closed_at":"2026-06-07T10:34:39Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.6.stable.arch_linux\n\n### System information\n\nArch Linux \n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen you have an animation state machine that has states like this, where A is the current node:\n\nA -> B -> D\nA -> C -> D\n\nwhere A->B and A->C are guarded by conditions, the state machine will take only one path every when you specify `travel(\"D\")`\n\nThe documentation is not clear here because it just specifies *the shortest path*.\nThe paths have both the same length and you would assume conditions would kick in in this case.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nSee MRP.\nYou need 4 States:\nA going to B\nB going to C, guarded by a condition\nB going to D, guarded by a condition (inverse of B->C)\nC going to A\nD going to A\n\nGoing to State B and travelling to A (either by code or within the State Machine) will always go through one path only (the one that was created first?)\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ab505bff-6fab-45a6-a815-f1e47b77546a\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[animation_mrp.tar.gz](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25682806/animation_mrp.tar.gz)","closed_by":{"login":"Raildex","id":14938934,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0OTM4OTM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14938934?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raildex","html_url":"https://github.com/Raildex","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raildex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raildex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raildex/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raildex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raildex/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raildex/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raildex/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raildex/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raildex/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116950/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116950/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}